el":"其他","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-creator:305428","source":"egs"},{"creditedName":"アルトステージ(ALTSTAGE)","creatorId":"egs:creator:24415","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:24415","canonicalEntityId":"egs:creator:24415","name":"アルトステージ(ALTSTAGE)","detail":"デザイン・WEBサイト構築","roleCode":"other","roleLabel":"其他","identityStatus":"no-alias-hit","relationId":"egs:work-creator:305429","source":"egs"},{"creditedName":"(株)デジタルギア","creatorId":"egs:creator:42999","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:42999","canonicalEntityId":"egs:creator:42999","name":"(株)デジタルギア","detail":"Live2Dアニメーション作成","roleCode":"other","roleLabel":"其他","identityStatus":"no-alias-hit","relationId":"egs:work-creator:305430","source":"egs"},{"creditedName":"呉","creatorId":"vndb:s507","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s507","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s507","name":"呉","roleCode":"staff","roleLabel":"制作人员","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:204486","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"やまかぜ嵐","creatorId":"vndb:s3913","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s3913","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s3913","name":"やまかぜ嵐","roleCode":"chardesign","roleLabel":"角色设计","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:204487","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"河奈 ナミ","creatorId":"vndb:s36282","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s36282","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s36282","name":"河奈 ナミ","roleCode":"staff","roleLabel":"制作人员","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:204492","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"天音 まりか","creatorId":"vndb:s39033","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s39033","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s39033","name":"天音 まりか","roleCode":"songs","roleLabel":"歌曲","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:204493","source":"vndb"}]},"cast":[{"characterId":"char_c135224","characterName":"高萩 瑠璃子","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"152810","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"481591"}],"egsCharacterIds":["25417"],"vndbCharacterId":"c135224"},"originalCharacterName":"高萩 瑠璃子","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The heroine of the first story, the protagonist's cousin."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From the protagonist's point of view, Ruriko's family is his \"Head Family.\" The Takahagi family is well-known in the area, its members are bank managers, so they are very wealthy. Born and raised as the only daughter of such a family, Ruriko has the looks and behavior like that of an ojousama. However──contrary to her appearance, she secretly harbors passionate desires. Since an early age, she sees the protagonist, her cousin, as a \"Man.\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"When her undesired arranged marriage comes up, the lust that has been hidden within her finally overflows."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated and edited from the official website"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c135224"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"１作目のメインヒロイン。主人公の従姉。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"瑠璃子の家は、主人公から見て“本家”に当たる。高萩家は地元の素封家で、銀行の経営者一族でもあり、非常に裕福だった。そんな家柄の一人娘として生まれ育ち、見た目も中身もお嬢様然としている。が──その清楚な見た目とは裏腹に、内には熱い情欲を秘めていた。瑠璃子は幼い頃から従弟である主人公を「男」として意識していた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"望まない結婚話が持ち上がった時、内に秘めてきた情欲がとうとう溢れ出ることになる。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"25417","sourceWorkId":"36038","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"１作目のメインヒロイン。主人公の従姉。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"瑠璃子の家は、主人公から見て“本家”に当たる。高萩家は地元の素封家で、銀行の経営者一族でもあり、非常に裕福だった。そんな家柄の一人娘として生まれ育ち、見た目も中身もお嬢様然としている。が──その清楚な見た目とは裏腹に、内には熱い情欲を秘めていた。瑠璃子は幼い頃から従弟である主人公を「男」として意識していた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"望まない結婚話が持ち上がった時、内に秘めてきた情欲がとうとう溢れ出ることになる。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"152810"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/3c/3c8d45c7ab523a26ee63f4d2c7271bff593c95dcf76a39e79a5dbda6c67970fd.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/33/33c1187adb8091a5ee117678192f961d37ffa7fc889677d669304c5cb27a40e8.webp","width":151,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"岡本理絵","creatorId":"vndb:s874","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s874","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s874","name":"岡本 理絵","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:481594:152810:13368:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c135225","characterName":"高萩 美玖","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"152811","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"481594"}],"egsCharacterIds":["26363"],"vndbCharacterId":"c135225"},"originalCharacterName":"高萩 美玖","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The heroine of the second story, the protagonist's younger sister."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Even though she looks cuter than most people, there is still something which makes her looks boyish. In addition, she is somewhat a peculiar girl, because she always wants to be with her brother. The kind of siblings relationship between them will continue to stay this way. Miku naturally bears that in mind, however......"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"One night, she witnesses the affair between her brother and her cousin. And because of that, Miku finally realizes after all this time, hidden within her, a certain desire."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated and edited from the official website"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c135225"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"２作目のメインヒロイン。主人公の妹。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"容姿は人並み以上に可愛らしいのに、何かと男の子っぽいようなところがある。その点、少々変わった女の子だった。昔から、兄である主人公といつだって一緒にいたがっていた。そんな兄妹関係は、この先もずっと変わらない。美玖は当たり前のようにそう考えていたのだが…。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ある日の夜、兄と従姉の情事を目撃してしまう。それをきっかけに、美玖自身もずっと知らなかった、内に秘めたとある願望を刺激されるのだった。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"26363","sourceWorkId":"36039","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"２作目のメインヒロイン。主人公の妹。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"容姿は人並み以上に可愛らしいのに、何かと男の子っぽいようなところがある。その点、少々変わった女の子だった。昔から、兄である主人公といつだって一緒にいたがっていた。そんな兄妹関係は、この先もずっと変わらない。美玖は当たり前のようにそう考えていたのだが…。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ある日の夜、兄と従姉の情事を目撃してしまう。それをきっかけに、美玖自身もずっと知らなかった、内に秘めたとある願望を刺激されるのだった。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"152811"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/1f/1fad25efaaff45ba5a9a34422f78b476173dcf665852368152a5c0ab5d680939.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/78/78e73bcd3200184abe6960236f5b40a15c087b8d76490b417d4d5f505f684d7b.webp","width":151,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"空賀花","creatorId":"vndb:s15476","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s15476","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s15476","name":"空賀 花","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:481594:152811:34089:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c135226","characterName":"絹佐 紫織","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"152812","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"481595"}],"egsCharacterIds":["26997"],"vndbCharacterId":"c135226"},"originalCharacterName":"絹佐 紫織","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The heroine of the third story, the protagonist's childhood friend. For a long time, she has been harboring her feelings for the protagonist."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Shiori originally had a weak body, which resulted in her being a bit withdrawn. Therefore, taking a step forward from being a \"childhood friend,\" was a difficult task for her. And for Shiori, she is fine with it as long as the four of them stay friends, and it cannot be anything else, however......"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Before she knows it, her group of friends has become completely different than before. When she learns of it, the feelings she had kept inside finally blossoms, like the blooming of a large sunflower."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated and edited from the official website"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c135226"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"３作目のメインヒロイン。主人公の幼なじみ。主人公とはお互いに昔から惹かれ合っていた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"紫織は元々病弱で、そのせいで何かと引っ込み思案なところがある。そのため、“幼なじみ”という関係から一歩を踏み出すことにも、なかなか積極的になれないでいた。紫織としては、４人での仲良しグループのままでも構わない。そんな風に思うことも、無いではなかったのだが…。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"いつの間にか、仲良しグループのカタチが、それまでとは決定的に違っている。…そのことを知ったとき、内に秘めた恋心が、花を開かせる。それは、大輪のひまわりのように。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"26997","sourceWorkId":"36040","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"３作目のメインヒロイン。主人公の幼なじみ。主人公とはお互いに昔から惹かれ合っていた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"紫織は元々病弱で、そのせいで何かと引っ込み思案なところがある。そのため、“幼なじみ”という関係から一歩を踏み出すことにも、なかなか積極的になれないでいた。紫織としては、４人での仲良しグループのままでも構わない。そんな風に思うことも、無いではなかったのだが…。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"いつの間にか、仲良しグループのカタチが、それまでとは決定的に違っている。…そのことを知ったとき、内に秘めた恋心が、花を開かせる。それは、大輪のひまわりのように。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"152812"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f9/f999774e90af0786f320e1a8dc813f13f059a39ea45297faad87ec4eac9da27e.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/fe/fee06e276ad7c191c6f3f21dd6be5159110aaf8b522f56d046254651d88a3f35.webp","width":151,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"風鈴みすず","creatorId":"vndb:s12799","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s12799","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s12799","name":"日向 結希","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatu